{"id": "EUVD-2026-103170", "enisaUuid": "97ecdc08-cf70-325c-ae9c-64d9d564348b", "description": "ERPNext is a free and open source Enterprise Resource Planning tool. Prior to 15.121.0 and 16.34.0, certain endpoints for status modification fail to enforce proper authorization checks. A low-privileged authenticated user can invoke state-changing whitelisted methods without required write, submit, cancel, document, or role checks. This allows the user to modify data beyond the user's permitted role. This issue is fixed in versions 15.121.0 and 16.34.0.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T20:38:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T14:29:00", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:H/A:N", "references": ["https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/security/advisories/GHSA-5wpj-6rvp-9ff7", "https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/commit/547d82da563380a0644919173e00d0205f986d89", "https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/commit/86e94803629ea5668c2fc2d18afb5ca59fe2cf03", "https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/commit/a20fc4f9317ecc7d262625aea680c9a0cda98cef", "https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/releases/tag/v15.121.0", "https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/releases/tag/v16.34.0"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108374"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "53bc67fa-5b04-3501-8aa3-ada6922a55ad", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "< 15.121.0"}, {"id": "5db145ed-cdd0-3f17-b9da-bcfd978397d8", "product": {"name": "ERPNext", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}, "product_version": "16.0.0, < 16.34.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5cf63ba8-a0c0-3bc5-932d-b8c3c2f79e3f", "vendor": {"name": "frappe"}}], "isExploited": false}